<\body>
  Figures, which the renderer must include rather than rasterize: a
  PostScript one, which goes through the converters and comes back as a
  PDF, and a raster one, which goes in as it is.

  <image|$TEXMACS_PATH/misc/pixmaps/unknown.eps|4cm|||>

  <image|$TEXMACS_PATH/misc/images/The_Jolly_Writer.png|3cm|||>

  The first must be a /Form XObject with drawing operators in it, the
  second an /Image; neither should be a picture of itself.
</body>

